2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
So I know this scout. he gets to be about 16, he gets his driver's permit and he gets his driver's license

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
and then he starts bugging dad about getting his own car.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
And dad is a little reluctant to do this and he says I'll tell you what:

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
finish getting the God and country award you started working on last year

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
and maybe get your hair cut and then we'll talk about getting you a car.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
So the scout really got a fire under him and he finished his religious award

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000
and he asked his dad about getting a car and dad was glad to see that he'd earned the award,

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
but he still wanted him to get his hair cut.

10
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000
His son replied he said he learned- I learned a lot about the Bible stuff in doing a religious award

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
and it turns out that all the guys in the Bible had long hair.

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Moses had long hair, Samson had long hair, Jesus apparently had long hair.

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Dad replies: yeah, did you also notice they walked everywhere that they went?

14
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Oh no, no, they didn't. the son replied:

15
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
I know that the apostles had a Honda.

16
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Dad looked a little confused and he said: how do you know that they had a Honda?

17
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
He says it says right there in the Bible, Dad, it says they were all in one accord.

18
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
They were all in one accord.

19
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Oh my,

20
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,000
That was a really long trip to get to that joke. okay,

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,000
And that I have to thank. we're playing.

