00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:48,000
ooh, you could almost call this- ages and stages.

62
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:52,000
We're going to talk about developing youth leadership in younger Scouts

63
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:55,000
and kind of how to tailor your approach to that

64
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:59,000
Kind of an expansion of talking to Blaise Vitaly last week

65
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:04,000
and younger Scouts, newer troop, newer scout leader,

66
